  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/qjonte2.png\" alt=\"Formations Overworld 橫幅\" width=\"1903\" height=\"797\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Formations Overworld</strong> 為各個主世界生態域新增了一系列全新結構！</h3><div>&nbsp;</div><div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/yl2Gq3d.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><h4><strong>結構</strong></h4><h5>以下為 Formations Overworld 中可發現的部分結構範例。更多圖片請參閱圖庫。</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/697/310/172/bamboo_hut.png\" alt=\"叢林中的竹屋\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/712/310/172/tower_remnant.png\" alt=\"古老塔樓遺跡\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/714/310/172/desert_houses.png\" alt=\"沙漠中的小型房屋\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/722/310/172/wagon.png\" alt=\"被積雪覆蓋的馬車\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"></p><div>&nbsp;</div><div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ksGhYpe.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><h4><strong>常見問題</strong></h4><h5><strong>我可以在自己的模組包中使用這個模組嗎？</strong></h5><h5>可以，歡迎將本模組用於您的模組包</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TNtFe30.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>Discord</strong></h4><h5>歡迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 伺服器，獲取最新內容、未來模組資訊並參與討論！</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" alt=\"Discord 加入按鈕\" width=\"373\" height=\"93\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/iLGGqDH.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/tsJvc9x.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/M8GKFFk.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>",
